# Every text file is LF in the repository and on checkout, Windows included.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.jar binary

# Full-size videos live in LFS, so they never weigh on every clone. The README shows their animated WebP copies.
docs/media/*.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# AGENTS.md is a symlink to CLAUDE.md. On Windows clone with `git clone -c core.symlinks=true`
# (Developer Mode or an elevated shell), or Git writes a plain file holding the text “CLAUDE.md”.
